{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_NOBUILTINS__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_NOBUILTINS__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when ##-z nobuiltins## disables nonessential builtin declarations and definitions, or zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptz|Compiler Option: -z]]

